# Python Machine Learning & Feature Engineering Labs

A repository of practical code labs, scripts, and notebooks covering end-to-end data preprocessing, categorical encoding, outlier handling, text feature extraction (`CountVectorizer`, `TfidfVectorizer`, N-grams), and model validation workflows using Python, Pandas, and scikit-learn.

